  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"78\">⚽ Xbox 360 Game – FIFA 16 | €4,99</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"308\"><strong data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"121\">FIFA 16</strong> brengt realistische voetbalactie naar de <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"175\">Xbox 360</strong> met verbeterde gameplay, tactische vrijheid en een groot aanbod aan teams en competities. De game is getest en <strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"307\">direct speelbaar</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"327\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"486\">\r\n<li data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"354\">\r\n<p data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"354\"><strong data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"343\">Platform:</strong> Xbox 360</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"376\">\r\n<p data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"376\"><strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"366\">Game:</strong> FIFA 16</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"407\">\r\n<p data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"407\"><strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"389\">Genre:</strong> Sport / Voetbal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"453\">\r\n<p data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"453\"><strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"424\">Spelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer & Multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"486\">\r\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"486\"><strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"469\">Toestand:</strong> Gebruikt, getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"501\">Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"678\">\r\n<li data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"534\">\r\n<p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"534\">Realistische voetbalbeleving</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n<p data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"574\">Veel teams, competities en spelmodi</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"612\">\r\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"612\">Geschikt voor solo en multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"650\">\r\n<p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"650\">Toegankelijke en soepele gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"678\">\r\n<p data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"678\">Direct klaar om te spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"689\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"700\"><strong data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"700\">€ 4,99</strong></p>",
